STR_GRF_NAME :OpenGFX3D Trams and Trolleybuses
STR_GRF_DESC :Trams and trolleybuses of the OpenTTD 3D fork, drawn from its 3D models. Trams run on street tramway, horse tramway and reserved tramway; trolleybuses need electrified road.
